[SIZE=6] 
[COLOR=#ff6600][B]Halloween Plugin v1.6.2[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

Bring the spooky spirit of Halloween to your Minecraft server!
This plugin adds fun, scary features designed to [B]surprise your players[/B] and create a creepy seasonal atmosphere.

Developed by [B]Softici s.r.o.[/B]

[B][COLOR=#ff9933]──────────────────────────[/COLOR][/B]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#ff9933]Features[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B][COLOR=#9900ff]Horror Sound Command[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#ff0000]NEW in v1.6.2![/COLOR]
- Play spooky horror sounds to specific players or everyone!
- Command: [ICODE]/halloween sound <player|@a> <sound>[/ICODE]
- 15 unique horror sounds: cave ambience, witch cackle, ghast scream, enderman, zombie, skeleton, creeper, wither, ender dragon, thunder, bell, portal, soul, sculk shriek, warden heartbeat
- Tab completion for players and sounds
- Perfect for events, pranks, and atmosphere!

[*][B][COLOR=#00ccff]Custom Command Prefix[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#ff0000]NEW in v1.6.1![/COLOR]
- Configure your own command to avoid conflicts with other plugins
- Set [ICODE]command_prefix[/ICODE] in config.yml (e.g., "scary", "spooky", "hw")
- When using custom prefix, [ICODE]/halloween[/ICODE] is completely unregistered and freed for other plugins
- Perfect for servers with multiple Halloween plugins!
- Works on Spigot, Paper, and Purpur

[*][B][COLOR=#999999]Spooky Login Greeting[/COLOR][/B] 
Players are welcomed with a chilling message when they join: 
[ICODE]Spooky times have arrived... Type /halloween disable if you don't dare to be cursed.[/ICODE]
[COLOR=#00ff00]NEW in v1.5.4:[/COLOR] 30-minute cooldown prevents pumpkin farming on join!

[*][B][COLOR=#ff6600]Pumpkin Curse[/COLOR][/B] 
- Every 1–10 minutes (configurable), a carved pumpkin appears on players' heads. 
- Items are safe — the plugin checks inventory space before swapping helmets. 
- After 3 curses, players' free slots fill with stacks of pumpkins (Easter egg). 

[*][B][COLOR=#8b00ff]Grave System[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#ff0000]NEW in v1.6.0![/COLOR]
Build elaborate graves and summon an [B]undead army[/B] to test your combat skills!
[B]How to Build:[/B]
[LIST=1]
[*]Place 3 wood planks underground (coffin)
[*]Cover with 3 dirt blocks
[*]Add RIP sign on middle dirt
[*]Build cross with stone walls (4 vertical + 2 horizontal at 3rd level)
[*]Place candles on opposite side
[*]Light candle with flint & steel!
[/LIST]
[B]What Happens:[/B]
- Dramatic 18-second animation (cross sinks → dirt vanishes → coffin transforms to nether bricks)
- [B]Undead army spawns:[/B] 3 Skeletons, 2 Zombies, 2 Skeleton Riders, 3 Zombie Riders (all with pumpkin helmets and glow!)
- [B]Buffed mobs:[/B] +30% health, +50% damage, +20% speed
- [B]Rewards:[/B] Chest with 10-32 pumpkins, cakes, skulls (50%), treasure map, 5 diamonds
- [B]Team XP:[/B] Distributed based on kill contribution
- [B]Protection:[/B] Disabled players cannot trigger graves

[*][B][COLOR=#cc0000]Epic Boss Battles[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#ff0000]NEW in v1.5.0![/COLOR]
[B]Pumpkin Monster (Zombie Boss):[/B]
- Summon: Place fence + carved pumpkin, ignite with flint & steel
- Stats: 100 HP, Diamond Armor, Mace weapon, +30% speed
- Rewards: 10-14 pumpkins, cakes, zombie head (rare!), glowstone, XP

[B]Halloween Boss (Skeleton Boss):[/B]
- Summon: Place lapis block + carved pumpkin, ignite with flint & steel
- Stats: 100 HP, Netherite Armor + Pumpkin Head, Bow, +30% speed
- [B]Summons minions:[/B] Cursed Bat (every 10s) and Haunting Phantom (every 60s)
- Rewards: [B]Ancient Debris[/B], phantom membranes, potions, 15-30 pumpkins, +40% more XP!
- [COLOR=#00ff00]v1.5.3:[/COLOR] Changed from Witch to Skeleton for balanced combat
- [COLOR=#00ff00]v1.5.4:[/COLOR] Disabled players cannot spawn bosses (anti-exploit)

[*][B][COLOR=#00cccc]Smart XP System[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#ff0000]NEW in v1.5.4![/COLOR]
- Prevents high-level XP exploits with intelligent scaling
- Low-level players (< 30): Get direct levels (3-7 levels)
- High-level players (≥ 30): Get raw XP (scales naturally with Minecraft's curve)
- Halloween Boss gives +40% more XP than Pumpkin Monster
- Fully configurable base rewards

[*][B][COLOR=#ffaa00]Pumpkin Villager Trading[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#ff0000]NEW in v1.5.0![/COLOR]
- Convert any villager: Right-click with carved pumpkin
- Becomes [B]Pumpkin Trader[/B] (Toolsmith profession, wears pumpkin helmet)
- Trading: 64 pumpkins ↔ 1 emerald (both directions)
- Daily limit: 64 trades per villager
- [COLOR=#00ff00]v1.5.4:[/COLOR] Reverts to normal villager when Halloween disabled globally

[*][B][COLOR=#9900ff]Random Pumpkin Mobs[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#ff0000]NEW in v1.5.0![/COLOR]
- 10% chance any mob spawns wearing a pumpkin helmet
- Drops 5-10 carved pumpkins when killed
- Works with zombies, skeletons, creepers, etc.
- Fully configurable chance and drop amounts

[*][B][COLOR=#999999]Slenderman Prank[/COLOR][/B] 
- An Enderman spawns 1 block in front of a random player and vanishes after 0.5s. 
- Creepy sounds + server-wide messages. 

[*][B][COLOR=#ff3300]Fire Prank[/COLOR][/B] 
- Harmless fire effect for a few seconds (no damage). 
- Broadcasts funny lines like: 
[ICODE]I fell into the burning ring of fire...[/ICODE]

[*][B][COLOR=#ffff00]Lightning Prank[/COLOR][/B] 
- Harmless lightning strike near a random player. 
- Thunder and cave ambience included. 

[*][B][COLOR=#000000]Darkness Event[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#ff0000]v1.4.0[/COLOR]
- Brief moment of blindness (1 second) with creepy atmosphere.
- Multiple layered trapdoor sounds + cave ambience.
- Random spooky messages broadcast to all players.
- Default 10-50 minutes between events.

[*][B][COLOR=#33cc33]Configurable Pumpkin Buffs[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#ff0000]v1.3.0[/COLOR]
- Wearing a carved pumpkin grants customizable beacon-like buffs
- Default: Haste II, Strength II, Speed II, Resistance II, Jump Boost II, Regeneration II
- [B]Fully customizable:[/B] Add/remove effects, change levels, toggle individual buffs
- 8 admin commands for real-time buff management ([ICODE]/halloween buffs[/ICODE])
- Supports ALL Minecraft potion effects (Night Vision, Fire Resistance, etc.)
- Toggle glowing effect independently
- Player glows with an eerie aura (configurable)

[*][B][COLOR=#ff9900]Progressive Cake Rewards[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#ff0000]v1.4.0[/COLOR]
- Wearing pumpkin helmet rewards cakes progressively
- 1st reward: 3 minutes → Cake
- 2nd reward: 6 minutes → Cake
- 3rd reward: 9 minutes → Cake
- Continues increasing by 3 minutes up to 30 minutes
- After reaching max: Cake every 30 minutes
- Players notified: "Next reward in X minutes!"

[*][B][COLOR=#00ccff]Server-Wide Announcements[/COLOR][/B] 
- All pranks broadcast randomized spooky messages to everyone. 
- Messages are fully customizable in [ICODE]messages.yml[/ICODE].
- [B]Auto-merging:[/B] Updates automatically add new messages without overwriting yours!

[*][B][COLOR=#ff0000]Player Protection[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#00ff00]Enhanced in v1.6.0![/COLOR]
- Players can [ICODE]/halloween disable[/ICODE] to opt-out completely
- Disabled players cannot spawn bosses or trigger graves (with helpful message)
- 30-minute join cooldown prevents pumpkin farming
- [ICODE]/halloween off[/ICODE] despawns all bosses, grave mobs, and reverts villagers instantly
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#ff9933]──────────────────────────[/COLOR][/B]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#ff9933]Commands[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[B]Player Commands:[/B]
[CODE]
/halloween help       - Show all commands
/halloween enable     - Enable effects for yourself
/halloween disable    - Disable effects for yourself
[/CODE]

[B]Admin Commands:[/B]
[CODE]
/halloween on         - Enable plugin globally (starts all tasks)
/halloween off        - Disable globally (despawns bosses/graves, reverts villagers)
/halloween reload     - Reload configs and messages
/halloween set <event> <min> <max>  - Adjust intervals
/halloween reset <pumpkin|helmet|all>  - Reset player states
/halloween sound <player|@a> <sound>  - Play horror sound (NEW v1.6.2!)
/halloween buffs <subcommand>  - Manage pumpkin buffs
[/CODE]

[B]Sound Command:[/B]
[CODE]
/halloween sound <player|@a> <sound>

Available sounds:
cave_ambience, witch_cackle, ghast_scream, enderman_scream,
zombie_growl, skeleton_rattle, creeper_hiss, wither,
ender_dragon, thunder, bell, portal, soul, sculk_shriek,
warden_heartbeat

Examples:
/halloween sound Steve cave_ambience
/halloween sound @a witch_cackle
[/CODE]

[B]Buff Management:[/B]
[CODE]
/halloween buffs list              - Show all buffs
/halloween buffs toggle            - Enable/disable buff system
/halloween buffs glow <on|off>     - Toggle glowing
/halloween buffs add <effect> <level>     - Add buff
/halloween buffs remove <effect>          - Remove buff
/halloween buffs enable/disable <effect>  - Toggle specific buff
/halloween buffs level <effect> <level>   - Change buff level
[/CODE]

[B][COLOR=#ff9933]──────────────────────────[/COLOR][/B]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#ff9933]Configuration[/COLOR][/SIZE]

Prank intervals and features are stored in [ICODE]config.yml[/ICODE]:

[CODE=yaml]
# v1.6.1 - Custom command prefix
command_prefix: "halloween"  # Change to "scary", "spooky", etc.

# Broadcast settings
broadcast_events: false  # If false, only affected player sees messages

# Grave System (v1.6.0+)
grave:
  enabled: true
  spawns:
    skeleton: 3
    zombie: 2
    skeleton_horse: 2
    zombie_horse: 3
  health_boost: 1.3  # +30% health
  damage_boost: 1.5  # +50% damage
  speed_boost: 0.2   # +20% speed
  pumpkin_drops_per_mob: 3
  xp_per_mob: 5
  rewards:
    pumpkins_min: 10
    pumpkins_max: 32
    cakes_min: 2
    cakes_max: 5
    skeleton_skull_chance: 0.5
    zombie_head_chance: 0.5
    diamonds: 5
    treasure_map: 1

# Pumpkin Monster Boss (v1.5.0+)
pumpkin_monster:
  enabled: true
  health: 100.0
  damage_boost: 2.0
  speed_boost: 0.3
  xp_reward: 10  # Base XP (scales with player level)

# Halloween Boss (v1.5.0+)
pumpkin_witch:
  enabled: true
  health: 100.0
  damage_boost: 3.0
  speed_boost: 0.3
  xp_reward: 15  # Base XP (+40% more than Pumpkin Monster)
  bat_spawn_interval: 10    # Seconds
  phantom_spawn_interval: 60  # Seconds

# Random pumpkin mobs (v1.5.0+)
random_pumpkin_mobs:
  enabled: true
  chance: 0.10  # 10%
  pumpkin_drops:
    min: 5
    max: 10

# Pumpkin Villager trading (v1.5.0+)
pumpkin_villager:
  enabled: true
  daily_limit: 64

# Event intervals
intervals:
  pumpkin:
    min: 1
    max: 10
  slenderman:
    min: 10
    max: 15
  fire:
    min: 30
    max: 60
  lightning:
    min: 20
    max: 40
  darkness:
    min: 10
    max: 50

# Pumpkin buffs (v1.3.0+)
pumpkin_buffs:
  enabled: true
  glowing: true
  effects:
    - type: HASTE
      level: 1
      enabled: true
    - type: SPEED
      level: 1
      enabled: true
    # ... customize as needed
[/CODE]

Prank messages are customizable in [ICODE]messages.yml[/ICODE]. Example:

[CODE=yaml]
slenderman:
  - "Slenderman almost got %PLAYER%... but vanished in shame."
fire:
  - "I fell into the burning ring of fire..."
darkness:
  - "%PLAYER% felt the darkness creeping in..."
pumpkinMonsterSpawn:
  - " %PLAYER% awakened a Pumpkin Monster!"
pumpkinWitchDefeat:
  - "⭐ %PLAYER% defeated the legendary Halloween Boss!"
graveAwaken:
  - " %PLAYER% has disturbed an ancient grave... something evil awakens!"
graveCurseBroken:
  - "✨ %PLAYER% has broken the curse of the grave and defeated the undead army!"
[/CODE]

[B]Auto-Merging:[/B] When you update the plugin, new messages and config sections are automatically added without overwriting your customizations!

[B][COLOR=#ff9933]──────────────────────────[/COLOR][/B]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#ff9933]Installation[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST=1]
[*]Place the plugin jar in your [ICODE]plugins/[/ICODE] folder.
[*]Start the server once to generate configs.
[*]Edit [ICODE]config.yml[/ICODE] and [ICODE]messages.yml[/ICODE] if desired.
[*]Use [ICODE]/halloween reload[/ICODE] or restart the server.
[/LIST]

[B]Upgrading from older versions:[/B]
Simply replace the JAR and restart. Your configs and messages will be preserved, and new features will be automatically added!

[B][COLOR=#ff9933]──────────────────────────[/COLOR][/B]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#ff9933]Compatibility[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Minecraft:[/B] 1.20+ (tested on 1.21.1)
[*][B]Server:[/B] Spigot, Paper, Purpur, or compatible
[*][B]Java:[/B] 17+
[*][B]Dependencies:[/B] None (standalone plugin!)
[/LIST]

